$DATUM Methyl 2-(4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinamido)acetate:
4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinic acid1 (8) (1.57 g, 4.68 mmol), methyl
2-aminoacetate hydrochloride (0.647 g, 5.15 mmol), EDC (1.35 g, 7.02
mmol), and HOBT (0.789 g, 5.15 mmol) were suspended in DMF (30 mL) and
stirred at room temperature under nitrogen overnight. DMF was removed at
low pressure and the residue was purified by SiO2 column chromatography
eluting with 0-6% MeOH in DCM. The desired product (1.42 g, 75%). 1H NMR
(300 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ ppm 8.90 (t, J=6.03 Hz, 1 H) 8.30 (s, 1 H) 7.71 (s,
1 H) 7.22-7.56 (m, 10 H) 5.33 (s, 2H) 5.32 (s, 2H) 4.02 (d, J=6.2 Hz, 2
H) 3.64 (s, 3 H).
